{"id":"vod_sn_37501","vodId":"37501","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"夜樱四重奏 花之歌","name_cn":"夜樱四重奏 花之歌","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b620fa2c9a1dbc8a2deaaf14f29d0f8c.jpg"},"summary":"根据龙之子工作室在推特公开的消息，由其制作的新作TV动画「夜樱四重奏 花之歌」将于今年10月开播。新作动画是「夜樱四重奏」系列时隔5年再次动画化，内容上并不是动画第二期，而是从漫画第1话开始重新制作，同时还加入了原创要素。新作的STAFF和CAST已经公开，STAFF和TV动画有较大不同，但声优并为改编原始阵容。　　漫画「夜樱四重奏」是安田铃人（本名安田典生）自2006年开始在「月刊少年天狼星」连载中的漫画作品。故事以樱新町为舞台，当樱新町连续在夜晚发生奇怪事件，在这个樱花林立的地方，因为得到非人类力量者的数量增加，令混沌程度越来越严重, 挺身面对他们的是“比泉生活协商事务所”所有成员，新感觉的感人动作故事，就此展开……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:00","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZiSswUQrYR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/92kJPzqjJT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dm3xzgL7nZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6HHM41UPKT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VYp0AmcUrW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0W69V4uNF21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/a1Ekqnxrnj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GQqTKJ1BSi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/W3e6V2r33D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ecchatkhq81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vznphU3wY31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7qXVFekw801/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jgxe8MAS2e1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:10.314Z"}